<section begin=intro />
'''Rift Torrent''' is a [[Warframe Augment Mod]] for {{WF|Limbo}}'s {{A|Rift Surge}} that increases Limbo's damage while in the [[Rift Plane]] for each enemy affected by Rift Surge.
<section end=intro />

